sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as User / Dashboard / GitOps
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Op as modelexpress-operator<br/>SA modelexpress-operator
    participant MX as modelexpress-server<br/>8001/TCP gRPC (optional TLS ≥1.2)
    participant Redis as Redis<br/>6379/TCP RESP (optional)
    participant Seed as Seed inference pod<br/>(MX client)
    participant New as New inference pod<br/>(MX client)
    participant Prov as HuggingFace / NGC / S3<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PVC as Cache PVC
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over User,Op: Flow 1 - ModelExpressServer reconciliation
    User->>K8s: Create ModelExpressServer<br/>HTTPS 443, user token, CEL validation
    Op->>K8s: Watch ModelExpressServer (all namespaces)<br/>HTTPS 443, SA token
    Op->>K8s: SSA: SA, Role, RoleBinding, PVC, Deployment,<br/>Service, NetworkPolicy, auth-delegator CRB (enforce)
    Op->>K8s: Patch CR status (endpoint, Ready)

    Note over MX,Seed: Flow 2 - P2P weight-source discovery (enforce mode)
    Seed->>MX: P2pService/PublishMetadata<br/>gRPC 8001, Bearer SA token
    MX->>K8s: TokenReview (audience check, cached)<br/>HTTPS 443, server SA (auth-delegator)
    K8s-->>MX: Authenticated ns:sa
    alt Kubernetes backend
        MX->>K8s: Write ModelMetadata CR + ConfigMaps<br/>HTTPS 443, SA token
    else Redis backend
        MX->>Redis: Store metadata<br/>RESP 6379, URL credentials, optional TLS
    end
    New->>MX: ListSources / GetMetadata<br/>gRPC 8001, Bearer SA token<br/>(namespace-scoped if tenantIsolation)
    MX-->>New: Source list (NIXL agent metadata)
    New->>Seed: Weight transfer<br/>NIXL RDMA (IB/RoCE/EFA), no TLS, no MX auth

    Note over MX,PVC: Flow 3 - Server-coordinated download and cache
    New->>MX: ModelService/EnsureModelDownloaded<br/>gRPC server stream, optional SA token
    MX->>K8s: ModelCacheEntry lease/claim (or Redis)
    MX->>Prov: Download model<br/>HTTPS 443 TLS 1.2+ (OpenSSL)<br/>HF_TOKEN / NGC key / SigV4
    Prov-->>MX: Model files
    MX->>PVC: Write to cache (filesystem)
    MX-->>New: Download progress / complete
    New->>MX: StreamModelFiles (no shared storage)<br/>gRPC stream 8001
    MX-->>New: File chunks

    Note over Prom,MX: Flow 4 - Metrics scraping
    Prom->>Op: GET /metrics 8443 HTTPS (service-ca)<br/>Bearer → TokenReview + SAR
    Prom->>MX: GET /metrics 9401 HTTP<br/>no encryption, no auth
